   "title": "Real impedance",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{The impedance $Z=5\\ \\Omega$ is a real}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{number, so it does not shift the}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{angle.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
